			"notes": "HeatCraft 0.2 is an unfinished early release for Minecraft 26.2. Back up worlds before testing.\n\nChanges in the current 0.2 build:\n- resolves the reported world-generation hang\n- resolves the reported crash-to-desktop and shutdown failures when leaving worlds\n- restores Jenny's intended movement speed\n- hardens scene teardown during disconnect and server shutdown\n- improves paid strip and blowjob scene camera handling\n- prevents participant geometry from appearing during payment and wardrobe staging\n\nKnown limitations:\n- some scripted scenes still need visual refinement\n- some scene camera angles still need refinement\n- other characters and broader gameplay systems remain unfinished\n\nRequires Fabric Loader 0.19.3+, Fabric API 0.158.0+26.2, GeckoLib 5.5.3+, and Java 25."
		},
